    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; Do you know everything happening at the Société francophone de Maillardville in October 2025 ? Dive into a new episode of Allô Maillardville, your community podcast hosted by Geneviève Kyle-Lefebvre and her team of contributors, in collaboration with Web Ouest. ⸻ 📅 Here are the key dates to remember for upcoming activities at the Société francophone [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
